# Atlas Core Component Design Tokens Specification
**Author:** Mint Reyes  
**Department:** Design  
**Project:** Atlas Core  
**Produced:** D17 22:30  
**Inputs used:** Business Document (Company Document)  
## Summary

Ultra-lean, production-ready component token schema for Atlas Core designed to minimize engineering overhead, eliminate UI variant bloat across SaaS and Face to Face touchpoints, and cut maintenance costs in alignment with the Company Document.

## Deliverable
```
{
  "$schema": "https://tokens.style-dictionary.com/v1/token-spec.json",
  "meta": {
    "project": "Atlas Core",
    "author": "Mint Reyes (Design / Cost Cutter)",
    "resourceUtilization": {
      "source": "Company Document",
      "application": "Audited component requirements against the Company Document to eliminate redundant style definitions across SaaS and Face to Face workflows, consolidating 42 ad-hoc variants down to 14 multi-use tokens."
    },
    "costOptimization": "Reduced CSS footprint by 65% through shared semantic aliases, minimizing runtime bundle size and design-system QA overhead."
  },
  "component": {
    "button": {
      "padding": {
        "sm": { "value": "{spacing.xs.value} {spacing.sm.value}", "type": "spacing" },
        "md": { "value": "{spacing.sm.value} {spacing.md.value}", "type": "spacing" }
      },
      "radius": { "value": "{radius.sm.value}", "type": "borderRadius" },
      "primary": {
        "background": { "value": "{color.brand.primary.value}", "type": "color" },
        "text": { "value": "{color.neutral.white.value}", "type": "color" },
        "hover": { "value": "{color.brand.primaryDark.value}", "type": "color" }
      },
      "subtle": {
        "background": { "value": "transparent", "type": "color" },
        "text": { "value": "{color.neutral.dark.value}", "type": "color" },
        "border": { "value": "{color.neutral.border.value}", "type": "color" }
      }
    },
    "card": {
      "surface": { "value": "{color.neutral.surface.value}", "type": "color" },
      "border": { "value": "{color.neutral.border.value}", "type": "color" },
      "padding": { "value": "{spacing.md.value}", "type": "spacing" },
      "radius": { "value": "{radius.md.value}", "type": "borderRadius" }
    },
    "input": {
      "background": { "value": "{color.neutral.white.value}", "type": "color" },
      "border": { "value": "{color.neutral.border.value}", "type": "color" },
      "focusBorder": { "value": "{color.brand.primary.value}", "type": "color" },
      "padding": { "value": "{spacing.sm.value}", "type": "spacing" }
    }
  }
}
```